<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/telecom">Telecommunications</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RF Modules &amp; Power Amplifiers</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Telecommunications products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/telecom/rf-assembly" aria-label="RF Modules &amp; Power Amplifiers" aria-current="page"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">RF</span><span class="label">RF Modules &amp; Power Amplifiers</span></a><a class="s" href="/capabilities/osat/hermetic-ceramic" aria-label="Fiber-Optic Receivers"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">FO</span><span class="label">Fiber-Optic Receivers</span><i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;"></i></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly" aria-label="Wireless Communication Modules"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">WL</span><span class="label">Wireless Communication Modules</span><i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;"></i></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us the frequency band and the package and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Telecommunications &middot; RF Modules &amp; Power Amplifiers</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RF modules and power amplifiers for telecom</h1><p class="mk-lede">RF, microwave and millimeter-wave module performance depends on controlled die placement, die-attach quality, grounding, shielding and package integrity. Hana combines these assembly processes with RF measurement to verify completed modules against program requirements.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-rf-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-telecommunications-card-rf-assembly.webp" alt="RF Modules & Power Amplifiers" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rf-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles RF and microwave modules, millimeter-wave modules and RF power amplifiers, drawing on high-frequency manufacturing experience developed over decades of telecom production.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">RF and microwave modules</span></div><div class="desc">Module-level RF and microwave assembly with controlled ground paths and shielding.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Millimeter-wave modules</span></div><div class="desc">Millimeter-wave module assembly on dedicated high-frequency manufacturing lines.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">RF power amplifier assembly</span></div><div class="desc">GaN-on-Si die in TO-272 plastic and metal-ceramic packages, including multi-die modules.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Frequency doublers</span></div><div class="desc">Frequency doublers for radio and broadband communication, encapsulated by seam seal and gross leak tested.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See System in Package for the wider multi-die integration, wafer-level processing and test capability supporting these RF module constructions. Fiber-optic receivers in hermetic TO-can and ceramic packages are covered under Hermetic &amp; Ceramic Packaging.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/osat/system-in-package">Explore System in Package <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/osat/hermetic-ceramic">Explore Hermetic &amp; Ceramic Packaging <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-plate pl-fade" data-plate-role="capability"><div class="art"><img src="/images/plate-rf-assembly.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Die attach, package sealing and RF measurement</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Die-attach selection forms part of both the thermal and electrical design of an RF package. Hana supports AuSn eutectic and sintered die attach according to the package requirements. Packages can be closed with a ceramic lid or hermetically sealed, with helium fine-leak test available for sealed parts. Completed modules can then be verified using spectrum analysis, network analysis and noise-figure measurement according to program requirements.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does assembly matter more at high frequency?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">At RF, microwave and millimeter-wave frequencies the assembly forms part of the electrical circuit. Die placement, voiding in the attach layer, ground-path continuity and shielding all affect how the finished module performs, so these variables are controlled in the assembly process and the result is confirmed by RF measurement.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What RF products can Hana assemble?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana can assemble RF and microwave modules, millimeter-wave modules and RF power amplifiers, including GaN-on-Si die in TO-272 plastic and metal-ceramic packages and multi-die modules. Fiber-optic receivers are packaged separately in hermetic TO-can and ceramic packages.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana test RF assemblies before shipment?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Completed modules can be measured on rack-and-stack RF equipment covering spectrum analysis, network analysis and noise figure, with the test set chosen to suit the program. Hermetically sealed packages can also be helium fine-leak tested.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/telecom" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Telecommunications market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your RF program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

